    "body": "I think the deduplication still needs to happen.\r\n\r\nAs for implementer interest, it's a bit tricky. WebKit hasn't established a position as of yet in part due to the many outstanding issues with Trusted Types. This refactoring on its own seems okay, but I would not want that to be taken as WebKit being okay with it in general.",
